## 🔌 PIL — USB tunnel

### A) إعداد الـ pil_config.yaml

```yaml
mavlink_tcp:
  host: 127.0.0.1      # USB tunnel via adb reverse
  port: 5760
```

### B) RESET قبل كل run (إجباري)

```bash
adb shell "am force-stop com.ardophone.px4v17"
pkill -f "pil_runner" 2>/dev/null
pkill -f "adb logcat" 2>/dev/null
sleep 2

# USB tunnel — يحتاج adb reverse + setprop
adb shell setprop debug.m130.target_ip 127.0.0.1
adb reverse tcp:4560 tcp:4560
adb reverse tcp:5760 tcp:5760

# تحقق
adb shell getprop debug.m130.target_ip          # يجب 127.0.0.1
adb reverse --list                              # سطران: 4560, 5760
adb shell "dumpsys battery | grep -E 'level|temperature' | head -2"

# logcat
adb logcat -c
adb shell input keyevent KEYCODE_WAKEUP
nohup adb logcat -v time > /tmp/pil_logcat_usbA.log 2>&1 & disown
```

### C) شغّل PIL (نفس الأمر للوضعين)

```bash
cd /home/wd/Desktop/GAB_3/1234/m13/m13/6DOF_v4_pure/pil
python3 -u pil_runner.py 2>&1 | tee /tmp/pil_run_usbA.log
```

